{"PageNumber":344,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":28,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَإِذَا ٱسۡتَوَيۡتَ أَنتَ وَمَن مَّعَكَ عَلَى ٱلۡفُلۡكِ فَقُلِ ٱلۡحَمۡدُ لِلَّهِ ٱلَّذِي نَجَّىٰنَا مِنَ ٱلۡقَوۡمِ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","TajweedText":"فَإِذَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>سْتَوَيْتَ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>َ وَم<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن م</tajweed>َّعَكَ عَلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْفُلْكِ فَقُلِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِى نَجَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نَا مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْقَوْمِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ظَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٨</span>","End":"٢٨","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":296,"MaqraNumber":137,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":29,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَقُل رَّبِّ أَنزِلۡنِي مُنزَلٗا مُّبَارَكٗا وَأَنتَ خَيۡرُ ٱلۡمُنزِلِينَ","TajweedText":"وَقُ<tajweed class=idgham_mutaqaribayn>ل</tajweed> رَّبِّ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نز</tajweed>ِلْنِى مُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نز</tajweed>َل<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>اً م</tajweed>ُّبَارَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>كًا و</tajweed>َأَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>َ خَيْرُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نز</tajweed>ِل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٩</span>","End":"٢٩","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":296,"MaqraNumber":137,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":30,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَٰتٖ وَإِن كُنَّا لَمُبۡتَلِينَ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ فِى ذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكَ لَأَيَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>تٍ و</tajweed>َإِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا لَمُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>تَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٠</span>","End":"٣٠","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":296,"MaqraNumber":137,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":31,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"ثُمَّ أَنشَأۡنَا مِنۢ بَعۡدِهِمۡ قَرۡنًا ءَاخَرِينَ","TajweedText":"ثُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نش</tajweed>َأْنَا م<tajweed class=iqlab>ِنۢ ب</tajweed>َعْدِهِمْ قَرْنًا ءَاخَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣١</span>","End":"٣١","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":296,"MaqraNumber":137,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":32,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَأَرۡسَلۡنَا فِيهِمۡ رَسُولٗا مِّنۡهُمۡ أَنِ ٱعۡبُدُواْ ٱللَّهَ مَا لَكُم مِّنۡ إِلَٰهٍ غَيۡرُهُۥٓۚ أَفَلَا تَتَّقُونَ","TajweedText":"فَأَرْسَلْنَا فِيهِمْ رَسُول<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>اً م</tajweed>ِّنْهُمْ أَنِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>عْبُدُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهَ مَا لَك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنْ إِلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هٍ غَيْرُهُ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ۥٓ‌ۖ</tajweed> أَفَلَا تَتَّق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٢</span>","End":"٣٢","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":296,"MaqraNumber":137,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":33,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَقَالَ ٱلۡمَلَأُ مِن قَوۡمِهِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ وَكَذَّبُواْ بِلِقَآءِ ٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ وَأَتۡرَفۡنَٰهُمۡ فِي ٱلۡحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنۡيَا مَا هَٰذَآ إِلَّا بَشَرٞ مِّثۡلُكُمۡ يَأۡكُلُ مِمَّا تَأۡكُلُونَ مِنۡهُ وَيَشۡرَبُ مِمَّا تَشۡرَبُونَ","TajweedText":"وَقَالَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَلَأُ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ق</tajweed>َوْمِهِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> وَكَذَّبُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بِلِق<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَخِرَةِ وَأَتْرَفْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمْ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَيَ<tajweed class=slnt>و</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>ٲ</tajweed>ةِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>دُّنْيَا مَا هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَّا بَشَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رٌ م</tajweed>ِّثْلُكُمْ يَأْكُلُ مِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا تَأْكُلُونَ مِنْهُ وَيَشْرَبُ مِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا تَشْرَب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٣</span>","End":"٣٣","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":297,"MaqraNumber":137,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":34,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَئِنۡ أَطَعۡتُم بَشَرٗا مِّثۡلَكُمۡ إِنَّكُمۡ إِذٗا لَّخَٰسِرُونَ","TajweedText":"وَلَئِنْ أَطَعْت<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>َشَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رًا م</tajweed>ِّثْلَكُمْ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكُمْ إِ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ذًا ل</tajweed>َّخَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>سِر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٤</span>","End":"٣٤","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":297,"MaqraNumber":137,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":35,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَيَعِدُكُمۡ أَنَّكُمۡ إِذَا مِتُّمۡ وَكُنتُمۡ تُرَابٗا وَعِظَٰمًا أَنَّكُم مُّخۡرَجُونَ","TajweedText":"أَيَعِدُكُمْ أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكُمْ إِذَا مِتُّمْ وَكُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ تُرَا<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>بًا و</tajweed>َعِظَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>مًا أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ُّخْرَج<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٥</span>","End":"٣٥","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":297,"MaqraNumber":137,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":36,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"۞هَيۡهَاتَ هَيۡهَاتَ لِمَا تُوعَدُونَ","TajweedText":"۞ هَيْهَاتَ هَيْهَاتَ لِمَا تُوعَد<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٦</span>","End":"٣٦","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":297,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":37,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنۡ هِيَ إِلَّا حَيَاتُنَا ٱلدُّنۡيَا نَمُوتُ وَنَحۡيَا وَمَا نَحۡنُ بِمَبۡعُوثِينَ","TajweedText":"إِنْ هِىَ إِلَّا حَيَاتُنَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>دُّنْيَا نَمُوتُ وَنَحْيَا وَمَا نَحْنُ بِمَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>عُوث<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٧</span>","End":"٣٧","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":297,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":38,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنۡ هُوَ إِلَّا رَجُلٌ ٱفۡتَرَىٰ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ كَذِبٗا وَمَا نَحۡنُ لَهُۥ بِمُؤۡمِنِينَ","TajweedText":"إِنْ هُوَ إِلَّا رَجُلٌ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>فْتَرَىٰ عَلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ كَذِ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>بًا و</tajweed>َمَا نَحْنُ لَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> بِمُؤْمِن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٨</span>","End":"٣٨","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":297,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":39,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ رَبِّ ٱنصُرۡنِي بِمَا كَذَّبُونِ","TajweedText":"قَالَ رَبِّ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>نص</tajweed>ُرْنِى بِمَا كَذَّب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٣٩</span>","End":"٣٩","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":297,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":40,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ عَمَّا قَلِيلٖ لَّيُصۡبِحُنَّ نَٰدِمِينَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ عَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا قَلِي<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>لٍ ل</tajweed>َّيُصْبِحُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ نَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>دِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٠</span>","End":"٤٠","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":297,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":41,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَأَخَذَتۡهُمُ ٱلصَّيۡحَةُ بِٱلۡحَقِّ فَجَعَلۡنَٰهُمۡ غُثَآءٗۚ فَبُعۡدٗا لِّلۡقَوۡمِ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","TajweedText":"فَأَخَذَتْهُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صَّيْحَةُ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَقِّ فَجَعَلْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمْ غُث<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ءً‌ۚ ف</tajweed>َبُعْ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>دًا ل</tajweed>ِّلْقَوْمِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ظَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤١</span>","End":"٤١","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":297,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":42,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"ثُمَّ أَنشَأۡنَا مِنۢ بَعۡدِهِمۡ قُرُونًا ءَاخَرِينَ","TajweedText":"ثُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نش</tajweed>َأْنَا م<tajweed class=iqlab>ِنۢ ب</tajweed>َعْدِهِمْ قُرُونًا ءَاخَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٢</span>","End":"٤٢","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":297,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false}]}